# AWS source lock

Do not invent ACM renewal rules, Private CA pricing, or CLI flags from memory.

1. Prefer facts in `.kiro/steering/aws-source-lock.md`.
2. Else link docs.aws.amazon.com or aws.amazon.com pricing (use aws-docs MCP).
3. Mark unverified lab evidence explicitly until an evidence pass.

When editing `docs/**` (especially `cost.md`), re-check claims before finishing.
Keep tone direct — no hedging lectures.
